      "refersTo": "book-cover",
      "description": "A typographic pink sleeve with cut-paper artwork.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-cover-link\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Explore sample story\"><div class=\"ds-cover\"><span class=\"ds-cover-top\">Breezer’s bookshelf / Fantasy</span><span class=\"ds-cover-title\">A little world</span><span class=\"ds-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"ds-cover-bottom\">THE SAMPLE COLLECTION <span>✳</span></span></div></a>",
      "css": ".ds-cover-link{display:block;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink,#342047)}.ds-cover{height:370px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;border-radius:2px 10px 10px 2px;box-shadow:7px 8px 0 #34204714;background:var(--pink,#f6b6d2);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;transition:transform .2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-cover:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:8px;border-left:1px solid #34204726}.ds-cover-top{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;position:relative;z-index:1}.ds-cover-title{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,3.1vw,3.4rem);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1;max-width:10ch;z-index:1}.ds-art{position:relative;height:125px;align-self:flex-end;width:85%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ds-art i{position:absolute;background:var(--grape,#45256e);width:110px;height:110px;border-radius:50%;left:5%}.ds-art i:nth-child(2){background:inherit;border:15px solid var(--grape,#45256e);left:35%;height:85px;width:85px}.ds-art i:nth-child(3){height:52px;width:52px;left:75%;border-radius:0;transform:rotate(30deg)}.ds-cover-bottom{font-size:.6rem;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.08em;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.ds-cover-bottom span{font-size:1.7rem;line-height:1}.ds-cover-link:hover .ds-cover{transform:translateY(-4px)}.ds-cover-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#b33168);outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-cover{transition:none}}"
